    "Settings.Items.LockContents": "Lock modification",
    "Settings.Items.LockContents.Tip": "Stops items from being added, removed or edited, here or on the dock — the dock's own commands go away, leaving a grayed-out Locked in their place, and a file dropped on the bar is refused. Reordering is unaffected.",
    "Settings.Items.Hint.Reorder": "Drag a row by its grip to reorder it, or double-click it to edit. On the dock itself: drag sideways to reorder, right-click for the same menu as here.",
    "Settings.Items.Hint.OrderLocked": "The order is locked: dragging a row here, or an icon on the dock, will not move it. Double-click a row to edit it; right-click an icon on the dock for the same menu as here.",
    "Settings.Items.Hint.ContentsLocked": "The items are locked: nothing can be added, removed or edited, here or on the dock, whose menu says so and offers only Dock settings. Dragging a row by its grip still reorders it.",
